  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO The Flexible Multi-Partner Mechanism (FMM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funds will support FAO&apos;s Flexible Multi-partner meachnisms with softearmarking to two main programmes: Resilience and Sustainable Food Systems and climate Action in Agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
